tones. The nine individual hues range from beige to yellow ochre to reddish brown ochre's. Handwritten in pencil are color notations on four (4) of the color cards.  Each color test was executed on an individual square of cardboard or heavy paper.  The squares, about 3\" on average, present individual samples of saturated color.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Color Cards, Shades of Earth Tones, 20th Century. Paper, cardboard and oil paint, 9 3/4 x 2 3/8 inches. Georgia O'Keeffe Museum. Gift of Juan and Anna Marie Hamilton. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum. [RC.1998.1.924]","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Gift of Juan and Anna Marie Hamilton","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Paper, cardboard and oil paint, 9 3/4 x 2 3/8 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/793545/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/793545"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"},{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/793546/full/fu